      "text": "Matende cried all the time."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "imagePath": "images/04.jpg",
      "text": "When his mother fed him, Matende cried."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "imagePath": "images/05.jpg",
      "text": "When Matende was put down to rest, he still cried."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
