      "text": "When his mother changed his nappies, Matende continued to cry."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "imagePath": "images/07.jpg",
      "text": "When his mother carried him on her shoulder, Matende cried more."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "imagePath": "images/08.jpg",
      "text": "When he fell asleep, Matende looked like he would start to cry again."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
